    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Note on exemption for political representatives";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "To avoid doubt, this section does not make exempt for the purposes of paragraph 7(1)(ee) an act or practice of the political representative, contractor, subcontractor or volunteer for a registered political party involving the use or disclosure (by way of sale or otherwise) of personal information in a way not covered by subsection (1), (2), (3) or (4) (as appropriate).";
