    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/operator> "breaches";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "The new partnership's use of personal information may breach National Privacy Principle 2.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "For example, the new partnership’s use of Schedule 1 Amendment of the Privacy Act 1988 personal information collected from the old partnership may constitute an interference with privacy if it breaches National Privacy Principle 2 or a corresponding provision in a binding approved privacy code.";
