    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/logicSummary> "Agency or organisation must comply with privacy principles.";
    <https://ns.webcivics.net/cml/premiseText> "(a) the act or practice of an agency or organisation that is the subject of an application under section 73 for a determination under section 72 breaches, or may breach: ...";
